# Presentations

This collection holds each responsible author's talks and presentation documents under their designated document homes.
An actual author collection has its own author README and index; detailed talk lists stay in that author index.
The [presentation index](index.md) locates actual author collections.
Apply the [writing rules](../../framework/rules/writing.md#projects-and-documents) and the responsible author's applicable choices to these document homes.
Mathematical statements, source inspection, computation evidence and research review remain in their responsible C/L/U/J/R materials.
This collection supplies document navigation and grants no research execution authority.
